#: ../../source/getpass_README.md:3
msgid ""
"Get a password from the terminal. Sounds simple? Sounds like the "
"`readline` module should be able to do it? NOPE."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/getpass_README.md:6
msgid "Install and use it"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/getpass_README.md:16
