#: ../../source/getpass_README.md:18
msgid "`mod_getpass.getPass([options, ]callback)`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/getpass_README.md:20
msgid ""
"Gets a password from the terminal. If available, this uses `/dev/tty` to "
"avoid interfering with any data being piped in or out of stdio."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/getpass_README.md:23
msgid ""
"This function prints a prompt (by default `Password:`) and then accepts "
"input without echoing."
msgstr ""

